-- 원래 예외를 본다

@Test
@Transactional
void 원인() {
    em.persist(new Member("둘", 10));
    em.persist(new Member("둘", 20));
    em.flush(); em.clear();
    try {
        memberRepository.findOptionalByUsername("둘");
    } catch (Exception e) {
        System.out.println("겉:  " + e.getClass().getName());
        System.out.println("속:  " + e.getCause().getClass().getName());
        System.out.println("말:  " + e.getMessage());
    }
}

겉:  org.springframework.dao.IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException
속:  jakarta.persistence.NonUniqueResultException
말:  Query did not return a unique result: 2 results were returned

